  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"193\" id=\"isPasted\">• <strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"191\">About Our Brand and Products</strong></h3><p data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"573\">Mozaico is a global leader in handcrafted mosaic art. We specialize in custom and ready-made mosaic designs made from premium marble, glass, and natural stones. With over 7,000 unique designs and a team of skilled artisans, we create timeless pieces that elevate both residential and commercial interiors. Every mosaic is crafted with precision and backed by a lifetime warranty.</p><hr data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\"><h3 data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"615\">• <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"613\">What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><p data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"1009\">Unlike mass-produced decor, each Mozaico mosaic is handmade and fully customizable. We blend ancient craftsmanship with modern design, offering truly one-of-a-kind pieces. Our commitment to quality, global shipping, and eco-conscious production sets us apart. We also offer full white-glove customer support and free design consultations to ensure every client gets exactly what they envision.</p><hr data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1014\"><h3 data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1051\">• <strong data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1049\">How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1269\">Interior designers can earn <strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1104\">up to 20% commission</strong> through our tiered structure, with increased rewards as sales grow. We provide generous payouts on high-ticket, luxury items — making each referral highly valuable.</p><hr data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1274\"><h3 data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1305\">• <strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1303\">How to Promote Us</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1345\">Affiliates can promote Mozaico through:</p><ul data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1638\"><li data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1388\"><p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1388\">Client consultations and design projects</p></li><li data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1429\"><p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1429\">Social media posts, stories, and reels</p></li><li data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1465\"><p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1465\">Blog content or website referrals</p></li><li data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1638\"><p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1638\">Email newsletters or mood boards featuring our mosaics<br data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1525\">We also provide professional marketing materials, sample visuals, and custom links to help you promote with ease.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
